    "The All-rounders against The Fortress, {0} matches, {1} per match. Inspect matches": "Les All-rounders contre The Fortress, {0} matchs, {1} par match. Inspecter les matchs",
    "The All-rounders against The Stormers, {0} matches, {1} per match. Inspect matches": "Les All-rounders contre les Stormers, {0} matchs, {1} par match. Inspecter les matchs",
    "The All-rounders": "Les polyvalents",
