    "Choose at least two style dimensions. Each selected value is standardized using the mean and population standard deviation across all {0} team-match records. The selected dimensions receive equal weight. Goals, shots and xG are reserved for outcome comparison.": "至少选择两个样式尺寸。每个选定的值均使用所有 {0} 个球队比赛记录的平均值和总体标准差进行标准化。所选尺寸具有相同的权重。进球数、射门数和预期进球数保留用于结果比较。",
