    "Discover pairs": "发现配对",
    "Discusses metric selection, strength bias and model stability. These ideas motivate the transparent, explicitly limited sensitivity checks in Robustness lab.": "讨论度量选择、强度偏差和模型稳定性。这些想法激发了鲁棒性实验室中透明、明确限制的敏感性检查。",
    "Displayed pass volume": "显示通过量",
