    "Distance covered (km)": "行驶距离（公里）",
    "Does a close style pairing survive a different metric choice or the loss of a single match? Inspect every scenario and see the alternatives that move ahead.": "风格接近的配对是否能在不同的度量标准选择或单场比赛失败的情况下幸存下来？检查每个场景并查看前进的替代方案。",
