    "Dots = individual matches": "点 = 个人比赛",
    "Dots use the same full-tournament standardized scale. The connector shows the gap. The share column allocates the pair’s squared distance across the retained indicators.": "点使用相同的全锦标赛标准化尺度。连接器显示间隙。份额列在保留的指标上分配货币对的平方距离。",
    "Download comparison CSV": "下载比较 CSV",
    "Download design and source notes ↓": "下载设计和源码说明 ↓",
    "Download full audit CSV ↓": "下载完整审核 CSV ↓",
    "Drag across the event strip to select a window. The two cumulative lines retain full-match context.": "在事件条上拖动以选择时段，两条累计曲线始终保留全场走势。",
    "Drag to select an event-time window; equivalent start and end controls are below": "拖动以选择事件时间窗口；等效的开始和结束控制如下",
    "Draw": "画",
    "ET1": "ET1",
    "ET2": "ET2",
    "Each dot is a match. Vertical marks show averages. Select a dot or match row to inspect its opponent and nearest comparable performances. Match totals include extra time when played.": "每个点都是一个匹配。垂直标记显示平均值。选择一个点或比赛行来检查其对手和最接近的可比表现。比赛总计包括加时赛。",
    "Each dot is one team's per-match average. The vertical tick is the average of teams in that group. Select a dot to inspect the team.": "每个点都是一支球队每场比赛的平均分。垂直刻度是该组中球队的平均值。选择一个点来检查球队。",
    "Each fixture is oriented toward {0}, regardless of home or away side.": "每个装置都面向 {0}，无论主队还是客队。",
    "Each selected metric has equal weight after standardization across all {0} team-match records. Distance is the root mean square standardized difference. Lower means closer.": "各项所选指标以全部 {0} 条球队—比赛记录为基准进行标准化，之后赋予相同权重。距离为各指标标准化差值的均方根；数值越小，风格越接近。",
    "Each step is one attempt · diamonds mark goals on recorded attempts": "每个阶梯代表一次射门 · 菱形标记射门记录中的进球",
    "Each team's style group comes from its tournament average. Different teams, opponents and sample sizes contribute to each cell. These are observed matchups within this tournament.": "每支球队的风格分组都来自其锦标赛的平均水平。不同的球队、对手和样本量对每个单元都有贡献。这些是本次锦标赛中观察到的对决。",
    "Edge A → B = recorded pass count from player A to player B. Node size is square-root scaled by incoming + outgoing counts.": "连线 A → B 表示球员 A 向球员 B 传球的记录次数。节点大小按接球次数与传球次数之和的平方根缩放。",
    "Edit style definition": "编辑样式定义",
