    "Event intelligence / {0}": "事件情报/{0}",
    "Event register": "事件登记",
    "Event replay ↗": "活动回放 ↗",
    "Event timing and player illustrations": "事件计时和玩家插图",
    "Events are recorded to whole minutes. Explicit {0}+, {1}+ and {2}+ labels are placed at the end of their corresponding period; period breaks are schematic gaps. Bare minutes are assigned to the usual period, with extra time used only for matches marked as such. Order within a minute is not precise. No time-normalized rates are inferred.": "事件时间记录精确到整分钟。明确标注为 {0}+、{1}+ 和 {2}+ 的补时记录放在对应比赛时段的末尾；时段之间的间隔仅作示意。未注明补时的分钟数按通常所属时段归类，只有明确标记加时赛的比赛才纳入加时阶段。同一分钟内的事件先后顺序并不精确，因此不据此推算单位时间发生率。",
    "Events": "活动",
    "Every directed pass involves a sender and recipient. Player totals use all network edges, including edges hidden by the display threshold.": "每次有向传球都涉及一名传球者和一名接球者。球员总量基于网络中的全部连线计算，包括因显示阈值而隐藏的连线。",
    "Every match": "每场比赛",
    "Every team mixes possession, pressing, crossing and counter-attacking. We measure ten of these dials from FIFA's phase-of-play data and place each team by them.": "每支球队都会混合控球、压迫、传中和反击。我们根据国际足联的比赛阶段数据测量了十个这样的刻度盘，并根据它们对每支球队进行了排名。",
    "Evidence, timing and coverage": "证据、时间安排和覆盖范围",
