    "Opponent context uses their other tournament games, excluding the selected encounter. Values use the full tournament, including games played later. This gives retrospective context for the comparison.": "对手上下文使用他们的其他锦标赛比赛，不包括所选的比赛。数值使用整个锦标赛，包括稍后进行的比赛。这为比较提供了回顾性背景。",
