    "Row plays column →": "行打列→",
    "Rows and columns use each team's fixed full-tournament style group. Each off-diagonal cell averages the selected metric for the row-group team in the relevant fixtures. A fixture appears once within a given off-diagonal cell. Diagonal cells link to games between teams in the same group. Their signed average would cancel by construction, so they display the match count.": "行和列按球队整届赛事的固定风格分组排列。非对角单元格显示相关交锋中，行所属风格组球队的所选指标均值；同一场比赛在一个非对角单元格内只计一次。对角单元格对应同组球队交锋，两队视角的带符号均值会按计算方式相互抵消，因此这里显示比赛场数，并可进入具体比赛。",
