    "Several source phase measures overlap. Rescaling them to sum to {0} creates a relative phase profile. The normalized values describe the balance among recorded phase measures, rather than mutually exclusive fractions of playing time.": "几个源阶段测量重叠。将它们重新调整为总和为 {0} 可创建相对相位分布。标准化值描述了记录的阶段测量之间的平衡，而不是播放时间的相互排斥的分数。",
    "Share of attempts in window": "窗口中的尝试份额",
    "Share of match time in each phase, as in FIFA's post-match report. Phases overlap, so they do not add up to {0}.": "每个阶段的比赛时间比例，如国际足联的赛后报告所示。相位重叠，因此它们加起来不等于 {0}。",
    "Share of the ball (possession, excluding contested time).": "球权份额（控球权，不包括比赛时间）。",
    "Shot blocked": "射门被挡",
    "Shot minutes are recorded as elapsed minutes and displayed in the following numbered minute, so {0}:xx appears as {1}. First-half stoppage time shares the axis with the early second half. Player avatars are stylized illustrations from the original project, with credits available in the player detail. A shirt number represents players without an illustration.": "射门时间按已过分钟数记录，显示时归入下一个比赛分钟，因此 {0}:xx 显示为 {1}。上半场补时与下半场初段共用时间轴区间。球员头像沿用原项目的风格化插画，来源署名可在球员详情中查看；没有插画的球员以球衣号码表示。",
    "Shot saved": "射门已保存",
    "Shot volume": "射出量",
    "Shot wide": "射门偏远",
    "Shots on target": "射门命中目标",
