    "Shots so far: {0} {1} · {2} {3}": "到目前为止的镜头：{0} {1} · {2} {3}",
    "Shots": "镜头",
    "Shows the timing and count of recorded attempts. Supplemental score-only goals and own goals provide score context without adding a shot. No per-shot xG or observed shot location is available.": "展示已记录射门的时间与次数。仅补充比分信息的进球记录及乌龙球用于说明比分变化，不额外计为射门。数据未提供每次射门的 xG 或实际射门位置。",
    "Signed model contributions to the goal difference gap": "模型各项对净胜球差异的带符号分解",
    "Similar goal difference": "相似净胜球",
    "Similar styles still spread out": "类似的风格依然流传",
    "Similar styles.": "类似的风格。",
    "Similar tactics.": "类似的战术。",
    "Similarity percentile among all {0} team pairs, using your {1} selected metrics. A higher percentile means a closer pairing.": "使用您选择的 {1} 个指标，所有 {0} 个球队对之间的相似性百分位。百分位数越高意味着配对越紧密。",
    "Similarity percentile {0}": "相似度百分位 {0}",
    "Similarity uses {0} selected style metrics": "相似度使用 {0} 个选定的样式指标",
    "Single-match comparisons show the root mean square distance across selected standardized dimensions. A lower distance means a closer profile. Candidate matches from the same team or the same fixture are excluded from the new match-comparison search.": "单场比较使用所选标准化维度上的均方根距离，距离越小表示风格特征越接近。新的单场近邻搜索会排除同一球队的记录，以及同一场比赛双方的记录。",
    "Sitting deep in front of their own box.": "深深地坐在自己的包厢前。",
    "Smaller rank = closer style": "较小的等级 = 更接近的风格",
