    "Sources, definitions & what this view can tell you": "来源、定义以及此视图可以告诉您什么",
    "Sources": "来源",
    "Standard deviations from tournament average": "与锦标赛平均值的标准差",
    "Standardized style values and distance contributions for the selected scenario": "所选场景的标准化样式值和距离贡献",
    "Standardized style values on one common scale. The middle line is the tournament reference mean.": "采用一种通用尺度的标准化风格值。中间线是锦标赛参考平均值。",
    "Standardized value (z)": "标准化值（z）",
    "Standardized value = (reported or transformed value − tournament mean) / tournament standard deviation": "标准化值 =（报告或转换值 - 锦标赛平均值）/锦标赛标准差",
    "Start here": "从这里开始",
    "Start with a team you know. Find its closest styles, compare the chances and scorelines, then inspect the matches behind the difference.": "从您认识的球队开始。找到最接近的风格，比较机会和比分，然后检查差异背后的比赛。",
    "Start with an observation": "从观察开始",
    "Start with the style map →": "从风格图开始 →",
    "Started": "开始",
    "Starting player": "首发球员",
    "StatsBomb’s playing-style research ↗": "StatsBomb 的游戏风格研究 ↗",
    "Statsbomb · Modelling team playing style ↗": "Statsbomb · 建模球队比赛风格 ↗",
    "Statsbomb · Reading passing networks ↗": "Statsbomb · 如何解读传球网络 ↗",
    "Statsbomb’s style research motivates separating style from strength and checking how a style model behaves under different evidence. Its published model uses event locations and a separate validation procedure. This site’s aggregate-data omission audit is an original, simpler check suited to the available records.": "Statsbomb 的风格研究旨在将风格与实力分开，并检查风格模型在不同证据下的表现。其发布的模型使用事件位置和单独的验证程序。该网站的聚合数据遗漏审计是一种原始的、适合现有记录的更简单的检查。",
    "Stoppage time": "伤停补时",
    "Stormers": "风暴者",
    "Story of the match": "比赛故事",
    "Strongest connections": "最强的联系",
    "Style Twins helps football fans compare similar approaches and investigate different opportunities and scorelines. Each view has a specific unit, calculation and interpretation.": "Style Twins 帮助球迷比较相似的方法并调查不同的机会和比分。每个视图都有特定的单位、计算和解释。",
    "Style Twins home": "Style Twins 首页",
