    "Style Twins": "Style Twins",
    "Style Twins. Teams: {0}. Selected source-clock window {1}–{2}. Minute-based order, no per-shot xG. Source {3}": "Style Twins。球队：{0}。所选原始比赛时间范围：{1}–{2}。顺序依据分钟记录，无逐次射门 xG。来源：{3}",
    "Style baseline": "风格基线",
    "Style contribution under the supplied ten-metric model. Its reference uses xG for and against from the {0} closest displays by other teams. Changing selected style metrics leaves this stored model estimate fixed.": "原有十指标模型中的风格项估计，以其他球队最接近的 {0} 次单场表现所创造和被创造的 xG 为参照。更改所选风格指标，不会重新计算这项已存储的模型估计。",
    "Style dials": "风格指标",
