    "Switch between group and knockout matches to see how the selected evidence changes.": "在小组赛和淘汰赛之间切换，看看所选证据有何变化。",
    "Switch teams to compare the mix. A different route distribution can reveal different ways of progressing the ball, even when overall possession is similar.": "交换球队来比较组合。即使总体控球率相似，不同的路线分布也可以揭示不同的传球方式。",
