    "Team profile →": "球队简介 →",
    "Team profiles average the full tournament. Cluster colors retain the original ten-metric grouping. Your metric selection travels with each comparison.": "球队概况平均整个锦标赛。簇颜色保留了原始的十度量分组。您的指标选择会随着每次比较而变化。",
    "Team similarity is a percentile among the available team pairings. A value of {0} means the pair is closer than about {1} of pairings under the selected dimensions and scope. It expresses a relative ranking. Inspect the individual dimensions to understand the actual resemblance.": "球队相似性是相对于当前可比较球队配对的百分位。数值为 {0}，表示在所选维度和比赛范围下，这两队比约 {1} 的球队配对更接近。它表达相对排名；具体有多相似，还需要查看各项指标的差异。",
    "Team to inspect": "组队前来考察",
    "Team values are in standard deviations": "球队价值观以标准差表示",
    "Team {0} difference per match by style group": "球队每场比赛的差异为 {0}（按风格组划分）",
    "Team-level counts and totals are shown per selected match unless labelled otherwise. xG per shot divides the aggregate xG by aggregate shots, so every shot has equal weight. A match with zero shots has no defined xG-per-shot value.": "除非另有说明，球队层面的次数和总量均按所选比赛折算为场均值。每次射门的 xG 用总 xG 除以总射门次数，因此每次射门权重相同。没有射门的比赛无法定义每次射门的 xG。",
    "Teams are classified by their whole-tournament style. Both home and away orientations are included.": "球队按照整场比赛的风格进行分类。包括主场和客场方向。",
    "Teams played three to eight matches. Averages can be driven by one large result. Inspect the individual matches, opponents and stage before extending a tournament pattern into a claim about lasting team ability. Extra-time games contain more playing time than regulation games, and these per-match measures include that extra time.": "各队只有三至八场比赛，一场极端结果就可能明显影响均值。把本届赛事的规律解释为球队的长期能力之前，应检查具体比赛、对手和赛事阶段。加时赛的比赛时长更长，这些场均指标也包含加时赛数据。",
    "Ten strongest directed links · node size = pass involvement · positions schematic": "传球次数最多的十条有向连线 · 节点大小反映传接球参与度 · 位置仅作示意",
