    "each arrow is a recorded count from one player to another across the full match. Node area follows incoming + outgoing counts. Involvement share divides this sum by twice the recorded network volume, because each pass has two endpoints. Thresholds only hide low-count links. These counts may differ from the report’s overall passing totals. The circular positions group playing roles and are schematic, not tracking locations. Substitutes remain included; the graph is not a simultaneous formation.": "每条箭头表示一名球员向另一名球员的全场传球记录次数。节点面积随接球与传球次数之和变化。参与占比用该球员的传接球总次数除以网络传球总量的两倍，因为每次传球都有两个端点。阈值只隐藏次数较少的连线。这些次数可能与报告中的整体传球总量不同。圆形布局按球员位置分类，仅作示意，并非追踪位置。图中包含替补球员，不代表所有球员同时在场的阵型。",
