    "Directed passing network. Choose a numbered player or use the player list.": "有向傳球網絡。選擇球衣號碼對應的球員，或使用球員列表。",
    "Discover pairs": "發現配對",
    "Discusses metric selection, strength bias and model stability. These ideas motivate the transparent, explicitly limited sensitivity checks in Robustness lab.": "討論度量選擇、強度偏差和模型穩定性。這些想法激發了穩健性實驗室中透明、明確限制的敏感度檢查。",
