    "Distance covered (km)": "行駛距離（公里）",
    "Does a close style pairing survive a different metric choice or the loss of a single match? Inspect every scenario and see the alternatives that move ahead.": "風格接近的配對是否能在不同的度量標準選擇或單場比賽失敗的情況下倖存下來？檢查每個場景並查看前進的替代方案。",
