    "Dots = individual matches": "點 = 個人比賽",
    "Dots use the same full-tournament standardized scale. The connector shows the gap. The share column allocates the pair’s squared distance across the retained indicators.": "點使用相同的全錦標賽標準化尺度。連接器顯示間隙。份額列在保留的指標上分配貨幣對的平方距離。",
    "Download comparison CSV": "下載比較 CSV",
    "Download design and source notes ↓": "下載設計和原始碼說明 ↓",
    "Download full audit CSV ↓": "下載完整審核 CSV ↓",
    "Drag across the event strip to select a window. The two cumulative lines retain full-match context.": "在事件條上拖動以選擇時段，兩條累計曲線始終保留全場走勢。",
    "Drag to select an event-time window; equivalent start and end controls are below": "拖曳以選擇事件時間視窗；等效的開始和結束控制如下",
    "Draw": "畫",
    "ET1": "ET1",
    "ET2": "ET2",
    "Each dot is a match. Vertical marks show averages. Select a dot or match row to inspect its opponent and nearest comparable performances. Match totals include extra time when played.": "每個點都是一個符合。垂直標記顯示平均值。選擇一個點或比賽行來檢查其對手和最接近的可比表現。比賽總計包括加時賽。",
    "Each dot is one team's per-match average. The vertical tick is the average of teams in that group. Select a dot to inspect the team.": "每個點都是一支球隊每場比賽的平均分數。垂直刻度是該組中球隊的平均值。選擇一個點來檢查球隊。",
    "Each fixture is oriented toward {0}, regardless of home or away side.": "每個裝置都面向 {0}，無論主隊或客隊。",
    "Each selected metric has equal weight after standardization across all {0} team-match records. Distance is the root mean square standardized difference. Lower means closer.": "各項所選指標以全部 {0} 條球隊—比賽記錄為基準進行標準化，之後賦予相同權重。距離為各指標標準化差值的均方根；數值越小，風格越接近。",
    "Each step is one attempt · diamonds mark goals on recorded attempts": "每個階梯代表一次射門 · 菱形標記射門記錄中的進球",
    "Each team's style group comes from its tournament average. Different teams, opponents and sample sizes contribute to each cell. These are observed matchups within this tournament.": "每支球隊的風格分組都來自其錦標賽的平均水平。不同的球隊、對手和樣本量對每個單元都有貢獻。這些是本次錦標賽中觀察到的對決。",
    "Edge A → B = recorded pass count from player A to player B. Node size is square-root scaled by incoming + outgoing counts.": "連線 A → B 表示球員 A 向球員 B 傳球的記錄次數。節點大小按接球次數與傳球次數之和的平方根縮放。",
    "Edit style definition": "編輯樣式定義",
