    "Event replay ↗": "活動重播 ↗",
    "Event timing and player illustrations": "事件計時和玩家插圖",
    "Events are recorded to whole minutes. Explicit {0}+, {1}+ and {2}+ labels are placed at the end of their corresponding period; period breaks are schematic gaps. Bare minutes are assigned to the usual period, with extra time used only for matches marked as such. Order within a minute is not precise. No time-normalized rates are inferred.": "事件時間記錄精確到整分鐘。明確標註為 {0}+、{1}+ 和 {2}+ 的補時記錄放在對應比賽時段的末尾；時段之間的間隔僅作示意。未註明補時的分鐘數按通常所屬時段歸類，只有明確標記加時賽的比賽才納入加時階段。同一分鐘內的事件先後順序並不精確，因此不據此推算單位時間發生率。",
    "Events": "活動",
    "Every directed pass involves a sender and recipient. Player totals use all network edges, including edges hidden by the display threshold.": "每次有向傳球都涉及一名傳球者和一名接球者。球員總量基於網絡中的全部連線計算，包括因顯示閾值而隱藏的連線。",
    "Every match": "每場比賽",
    "Every team mixes possession, pressing, crossing and counter-attacking. We measure ten of these dials from FIFA's phase-of-play data and place each team by them.": "每支球隊都會混合控球、壓迫、傳球和反擊。我們根據國際足總的比賽階段數據測量了十個這樣的刻度盤，並根據它們對每支球隊進行了排名。",
