    "Opponent averages across their other tournament matches. Each estimate excludes the match being inspected and includes later matches.": "對手在其他錦標賽比賽中的平均水準。每個估計不包括正在檢查的比賽並包括後來的比賽。",
    "Opponent context summarizes each opponent's xG created and allowed in its other tournament matches, excluding the fixture being inspected. The sample count appears with the estimate. This is retrospective schedule context and can include games played after the selected match.": "對手背景彙總對手在本屆賽事其他比賽中創造和被創造的 xG，排除正在查看的這場比賽，並同時顯示樣本數量。這是賽後回顧性的賽程參照，可能使用發生在所選比賽之後的記錄。",
    "Opponent context uses their other tournament games, excluding the selected encounter. Values use the full tournament, including games played later. This gives retrospective context for the comparison.": "對手上下文使用他們的其他錦標賽比賽，不包括所選的比賽。數值使用整個錦標賽，包括稍後進行的比賽。這為比較提供了回顧性背景。",
