    "Recorded attempt counts reconcile to the source team totals: {0} {1}/{2}; {3} {4}/{5}.": "記錄的嘗試計數與來源球隊總數一致：{0} {1}/{2}； {3} {4}/{5}。",
    "Recorded attempt counts reconcile to the source team totals: {0}. {1}": "記錄的嘗試計數與來源球隊總數相符：{0}。 {1}",
    "Recorded network passes are the sum of the supplied directed edge counts. They need not equal a separate team passing statistic. Time selections in Match pulse apply to timed events; full-match networks and phase measures have no equivalent event-level time stamps.": "網絡傳球總量是資料中所有有向連線次數之和，未必等於單獨發布的球隊傳球統計。比賽脈動中的時間篩選僅適用於帶時間記錄的事件；全場傳球網絡和比賽階段指標沒有對應的逐事件時間戳。",
