    "Remove an indicator": "刪除一個指示器",
    "Remove each selected indicator in turn, recompute team profiles in the remaining dimensions, and rerank the same candidate teams. This probe needs at least three selected indicators.": "依次剔除一項所選指標，在剩餘維度上重新計算球隊特徵，並對同一組候選球隊重新排名。此檢驗至少需要先選擇三項指標。",
    "Remove one team-match from either compared team, recompute that team’s average, and rerank. Other team profiles stay fixed. A team needs at least two matches for this probe.": "從所比較的任一球隊中剔除一場比賽記錄，重新計算該隊均值和相似性排名，其他球隊的特徵保持不變。被檢驗的球隊至少需要有兩場比賽。",
    "Replaces {0}": "替換{0}",
