    "Round of {0}": "{0}輪",
    "Row = passer; column = recipient. Each cell contains the same directed count as the network. The minimum-pass setting filters visible connections.": "行表示傳球者，列表示接球者。每個儲存格的有向傳球次數與網絡圖一致。最低傳球次數設定僅篩選顯示的連線。",
    "Row plays column →": "行打列→",
    "Rows and columns use each team's fixed full-tournament style group. Each off-diagonal cell averages the selected metric for the row-group team in the relevant fixtures. A fixture appears once within a given off-diagonal cell. Diagonal cells link to games between teams in the same group. Their signed average would cancel by construction, so they display the match count.": "行和列按球隊整屆賽事的固定風格分組排列。非對角儲存格顯示相關交鋒中，行所屬風格組球隊的所選指標均值；同一場比賽在一個非對角儲存格內只計一次。對角儲存格對應同組球隊交鋒，兩隊視角的帶符號均值會按計算方式相互抵消，因此這裡顯示比賽場數，並可進入具體比賽。",
    "Rows send → columns receive": "行發送→列接收",
