    "Several source phase measures overlap. Rescaling them to sum to {0} creates a relative phase profile. The normalized values describe the balance among recorded phase measures, rather than mutually exclusive fractions of playing time.": "幾個源階段測量重疊。將它們重新調整為總和為 {0} 可建立相對相位分佈。標準化值描述了記錄的階段測量之間的平衡，而不是播放時間的相互排斥的分數。",
    "Share of attempts in window": "視窗中的嘗試份額",
    "Share of match time in each phase, as in FIFA's post-match report. Phases overlap, so they do not add up to {0}.": "每個階段的比賽時間比例，如國際足總的賽後報告所示。相位重疊，因此它們加起來不等於 {0}。",
    "Share of the ball (possession, excluding contested time).": "球權份額（控球權，不包括比賽時間）。",
