    "Shot minutes are recorded as elapsed minutes and displayed in the following numbered minute, so {0}:xx appears as {1}. First-half stoppage time shares the axis with the early second half. Player avatars are stylized illustrations from the original project, with credits available in the player detail. A shirt number represents players without an illustration.": "射門時間按已過分鐘數記錄，顯示時歸入下一個比賽分鐘，因此 {0}:xx 顯示為 {1}。上半場補時與下半場初段共用時間軸區間。球員頭像沿用原項目的風格化插畫，來源署名可在球員詳情中查看；沒有插畫的球員以球衣號碼表示。",
