    "Shows the timing and count of recorded attempts. Supplemental score-only goals and own goals provide score context without adding a shot. No per-shot xG or observed shot location is available.": "展示已記錄射門的時間與次數。僅補充比分資訊的進球記錄及烏龍球用於說明比分變化，不額外計為射門。資料未提供每次射門的 xG 或實際射門位置。",
    "Signed model contributions to the goal difference gap": "模型各項對淨勝球差異的帶符號分解",
    "Similar goal difference": "相似淨勝球",
    "Similar styles still spread out": "相似風格也會呈現不同表現",
