    "Similarity percentile among all {0} team pairs, using your {1} selected metrics. A higher percentile means a closer pairing.": "使用您選擇的 {1} 個指標，所有 {0} 個球隊對之間的相似性百分位數。百分位數越高意味著配對越緊密。",
