    "Single-match comparisons show the root mean square distance across selected standardized dimensions. A lower distance means a closer profile. Candidate matches from the same team or the same fixture are excluded from the new match-comparison search.": "單場比較使用所選標準化維度之間的均方根距離。距離越小，代表特徵越接近。新加入的單場比較搜尋會排除同一支球隊，以及同一場比賽另一方的記錄。",
