    "Start here": "從這裡開始",
    "Start with a team you know. Find its closest styles, compare the chances and scorelines, then inspect the matches behind the difference.": "從熟悉的球隊出發，找出風格相近的球隊，比較機會與比分，再深入查看造成差異的具體比賽。",
