    "Statsbomb · Reading passing networks ↗": "StatsBomb · 解讀傳球網絡 ↗",
    "Statsbomb’s style research motivates separating style from strength and checking how a style model behaves under different evidence. Its published model uses event locations and a separate validation procedure. This site’s aggregate-data omission audit is an original, simpler check suited to the available records.": "StatsBomb 的風格研究啟發我們區分打法與實力，並檢查風格模型在不同證據下的表現。其公開模型使用事件位置資料及獨立的驗證程序。本網站基於彙總資料設計剔除檢驗，以較簡單的方法檢查現有記錄的敏感性。",
