    "Team similarity is a percentile among the available team pairings. A value of {0} means the pair is closer than about {1} of pairings under the selected dimensions and scope. It expresses a relative ranking. Inspect the individual dimensions to understand the actual resemblance.": "球隊相似性是相對於目前可比較球隊配對的百分位。數值為 {0}，表示在所選維度和比賽範圍下，這兩隊比約 {1} 的球隊配對更接近。它表達相對排名；具體有多相似，還需要查看各項指標的差異。",
