    "Team {0} difference per match by style group": "球隊每場比賽的差異為 {0}（依風格組別劃分）",
    "Team-level counts and totals are shown per selected match unless labelled otherwise. xG per shot divides the aggregate xG by aggregate shots, so every shot has equal weight. A match with zero shots has no defined xG-per-shot value.": "除非另有說明，球隊層面的次數和總量均按所選比賽折算為場均值。每次射門的 xG 用總 xG 除以總射門次數，因此每次射門權重相同。沒有射門的比賽無法定義每次射門的 xG。",
    "Teams are classified by their whole-tournament style. Both home and away orientations are included.": "球隊依照整場比賽的風格進行分類。包括主場和客場方向。",
    "Teams played three to eight matches. Averages can be driven by one large result. Inspect the individual matches, opponents and stage before extending a tournament pattern into a claim about lasting team ability. Extra-time games contain more playing time than regulation games, and these per-match measures include that extra time.": "各隊只有三至八場比賽，一場極端結果就可能明顯影響均值。把本屆賽事的規律解釋為球隊的長期能力之前，應檢查具體比賽、對手和賽事階段。加時賽的比賽時長更長，這些場均指標也包含加時賽資料。",
