    "each arrow is a recorded count from one player to another across the full match. Node area follows incoming + outgoing counts. Involvement share divides this sum by twice the recorded network volume, because each pass has two endpoints. Thresholds only hide low-count links. These counts may differ from the report’s overall passing totals. The circular positions group playing roles and are schematic, not tracking locations. Substitutes remain included; the graph is not a simultaneous formation.": "每條箭頭表示一名球員向另一名球員的全場傳球記錄次數。節點面積隨接球與傳球次數之和變化。參與佔比用該球員的傳接球總次數除以網絡傳球總量的兩倍，因為每次傳球都有兩個端點。閾值只隱藏次數較少的連線。這些次數可能與報告中的整體傳球總量不同。圓形佈局按球員位置分類，僅作示意，並非追蹤位置。圖中包含替補球員，不代表所有球員同時在場的陣型。",
